    "title": "Merry Christmas From The eWrestlingNews.com Staff! - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Anthony Mango ,\n41 minutes ago\nOn behalf of all of us here at eWrestlingNews.com, we’d like to wish everyone a happy holiday season.\nIf you get any good wrestling swag, feel free to share it in the comments and show off!\nREAD MORE: WWE Alum Killer Kross Joins Cast Of Godshot Film Based On True Events\nREAD MORE: WWE Alum Tenille Dashwood And Mike Rallis Expecting Second Child\nHere’s hoping everyone stays safe, has a lot of fun, and can roll into the new year ready to make it a great one!\nThanks so much for your continued support.\n– The entire eWn staff!",
